ING.'}{'symbol': 'BAC', 'date': '2023-02-13 09:07:00', 'title': 'BOFA COMMUNITY DEVELOPMENT BANKING PROVIDES RECORD $7.85 BILLION IN LENDING AND INVESTING IN 2022', 'text': 'SIXTH CONSECUTIVE RECORD YEAR, DOUBLED FINANCING SINCE 2016, BY PROVIDING INNOVATIVE AFFORDABLE HOUSING FINANCING SOLUTIONS NEW YORK , FEB. 13, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BANK OF AMERICA COMMUNITY DEVELOPMENT BANKING (CDB) PROVIDED $7.85 BILLION IN LOANS, TAX CREDIT EQUITY INVESTMENTS, AND OTHER REAL ESTATE DEVELOPMENT SOLUTIONS IN 2022, SURPASSING A PREVIOUS RECORD OF $6.7 BILLION IN FINANCING IN 2021. IN ITS SIXTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR OF RECORD GROWTH, CDB DOUBLED ITS FINANCING SINCE 2016.'}{'symbol': 'BBWI', 'date': '2023-02-13 12:08:00', 'title': 'BATH & BODY WORKS APPOINTS LUCY BRADY TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'HIGHLY ACCOMPLISHED EXECUTIVE WITH OVER 25 YEARS OF CONSUMER, DIGITAL AND MANAGEMENT EXPERIENCE HIGHLY ACCOMPLISHED EXECUTIVE WITH OVER 25 YEARS OF CONSUMER, DIGITAL AND MANAGEMENT EXPERIENCE'}{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2023-02-13 06:00:00', 'title': 'RBC ISHARES EXPANDS ETF OFFERINGS TO PROVIDE MORE PRECISE AND TARGETED SOLUTIONS', 'text': 'TORONTO, FEB. 13, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TODAY, RBC ISHARES EXPANDS ITS EXCHANGE TRADED FUND (“ETF”) LINEUP WITH THE LAUNCH OF FIVE ISHARES ETFS.'}{'symbol': 'BK', 'date': '2023-02-13 16:15:00', 'title': 'BNY MELLON TO SPEAK AT THE RBC CAPITAL MARKETS GLOBAL FINANCIAL INSTITUTIONS CONFERENCE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , FEB. 13, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BANK OF NEW YORK MELLON CORPORATION ("BNY MELLON") (NYSE: BK) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ROBIN VINCE, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, WILL SPEAK AT THE RBC CAPITAL MARKETS GLOBAL FINANCIAL INSTITUTIONS CONFERENCE, IN NEW YORK, AT 4:00 P.M. ET ON TUESDAY, MARCH 7, 2023.'}{'symbol': 'BSX', 'date': '2023-02-13 09:30:00', 'title': "BOSTON SCIENTIFIC TO PARTICIPATE IN CITI'S 2023 HEALTHCARE SERVICES, MEDTECH, TOOLS & HCIT CONFERENCE", 'text': "MARLBOROUGH, MASS. , FEB. 13, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BOSTON SCIENTIFIC