– INITIALLY WILL EMPLOY 2,500 PEOPLE WHEN PRODUCTION OF LFP BATTERIES BEGINS IN 2026."}{'symbol': 'BEN', 'date': '2023-02-13 16:00:00', 'title': 'FRANKLIN TEMPLETON NAMES LEEOR P. AVIGDOR AS SVP, GLOBAL TREASURER AND HEAD OF M&A', 'text': "SAN MATEO, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FRANKLIN RESOURCES, INC. [NYSE:BEN], A GLOBAL INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT ORGANIZATION OPERATING AS FRANKLIN TEMPLETON, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF LEEOR P. AVIGDOR AS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, GLOBAL TREASURER AND HEAD OF M&A. AVIGDOR WILL CONTINUE TO BE BASED IN FRANKLIN TEMPLETON'S NEW YORK OFFICE AND WILL REPORT TO MATTHEW NICHOLLS, EVP, CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER AND CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER."}{'symbol': 'FCX', 'date': '2023-02-12 22:42:00', 'title': 'FREEPORT-MCMORAN PROVIDES UPDATE ON PT FREEPORT INDONESIA OPERATIONS', 'text': "PHOENIX--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FREEPORT-MCMORAN INC. (NYSE: FCX) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT PT FREEPORT INDONESIA'S (PT-FI) GRASBERG OPERATIONS HAVE BEEN TEMPORARILY DISRUPTED BECAUSE OF SIGNIFICANT RAINFALL AND LANDSLIDES IN THE AREA OF ITS MILLING OPERATIONS IN PAPUA, INDONESIA. INTENSE RAINS ON SATURDAY FEBRUARY 11, 2023, RESULTED IN FLOODING AND A FLOW OF DEBRIS, CAUSING DAMAGE TO INFRASTRUCTURE NEAR ITS MILLING COMPLEX. PERSONNEL WERE SAFELY EVACUATED FROM THE LOCALIZED AREA."}{'symbol': 'GPN', 'date': '2023-02-13 16:00:00', 'title': 'ROSEN, NATIONAL INVESTOR COUNSEL, ENCOURAGES GLOBAL PAYMENTS, INC. INVESTORS WITH LOSSES IN EXCESS OF $100K TO SECURE COUNSEL BEFORE IMPORTANT DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION - GPN', 'text': 'NEW YORK , FEB. 13, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WHY: ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, ANNOUNCES THE FILING OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF PURCHASERS OF SECURITIES OF GLOBAL PAYMENTS, INC., (NYSE: GPN) BETWEEN OCTOBER 31, 2019 AND OCTOBER 18, 2022, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"). A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS ALREADY BEEN FILED.'}{'symbol': 'GPN', 'date': '2023-02-13 10:34:00', 'title': 'PARTHENON CAPITAL ANNOUNCES TRANSITION OF